      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an AI job-matching assistant.\n\nEvaluate the following job against these candidate preferences:\n- Target roles: AI/ML Engineer, Software Engineer, Data Analyst\n- Opportunity types: Full-time and Internship\n- Preferred location: India\n- Experience level: Fresher or 0–2 years\n\nJob details:\nTitle: {{ $json.job_title }}\nCompany: {{ $json.company }}\nLocation: {{ $json.location }}\nJob type: {{ $json.job_type }}\nExperience level: {{ $json.experience_level }}\nRequired skills: {{ $json.required_skills }}\nDescription: {{ $json.job_description }}\n\nEvaluate role relevance, location, employment type, experience requirements, and skills. Do not assume missing information is confirmed. Penalize clear mismatches and use a neutral score when details are insufficient.\n\nReturn ONLY valid JSON in this exact format:\n{\n  \"match_score\": 0,\n  \"match_reason\": \"Brief explanation of the score\"\n}\n\nThe match_score must be an integer from 0 to 100. Keep match_reason concise.",
